{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T00:33:45+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Polyrhythm Lab", "steam_appid": 2862580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polyrhythm Lab is a polyrhythm generator. It allows you to build infinite combinations of sounds and rhythms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/01d701e0a5f6d7da31ab5f4030d4ee63.poster.avif?t=1761090806\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/01d701e0a5f6d7da31ab5f4030d4ee63.webm?t=1761090806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/01d701e0a5f6d7da31ab5f4030d4ee63.mp4?t=1761090806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polyrhythm Lab creates stunning visualisations of the polyrhythms you design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/f315c6078753e22aea7bcbacf13f94ee.poster.avif?t=1761090806\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/f315c6078753e22aea7bcbacf13f94ee.webm?t=1761090806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/f315c6078753e22aea7bcbacf13f94ee.mp4?t=1761090806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polyrhythm Lab allows you to control the number of notes and chords, with control over each notes pitch, and rhythm pattern. You can modulate the global time, and global pitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/92c927305507b97762f61ec288304240.avif?t=1761090806\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can import any wav file as a sample, and then there is inbuilt reverb and low pass filtering controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even customise the layout to keep open only the parameters that you are tweaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/4b7967784715dc8cdca9af263ed70753.avif?t=1761090806\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the visual end, you can control bloom, particles, the motion of the notes, as well as the shape. You can set them to any colour you like as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even export your polyrhythms to MIDI, allowing them to be used in your DAW of choice.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polyrhythm Lab is a polyrhythm generator. It allows you to build infinite combinations of sounds and rhythms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/01d701e0a5f6d7da31ab5f4030d4ee63.poster.avif?t=1761090806\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/01d701e0a5f6d7da31ab5f4030d4ee63.webm?t=1761090806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/01d701e0a5f6d7da31ab5f4030d4ee63.mp4?t=1761090806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polyrhythm Lab creates stunning visualisations of the polyrhythms you design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/f315c6078753e22aea7bcbacf13f94ee.poster.avif?t=1761090806\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/f315c6078753e22aea7bcbacf13f94ee.webm?t=1761090806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/f315c6078753e22aea7bcbacf13f94ee.mp4?t=1761090806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polyrhythm Lab allows you to control the number of notes and chords, with control over each notes pitch, and rhythm pattern. You can modulate the global time, and global pitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/92c927305507b97762f61ec288304240.avif?t=1761090806\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can import any wav file as a sample, and then there is inbuilt reverb and low pass filtering controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even customise the layout to keep open only the parameters that you are tweaking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/extras/4b7967784715dc8cdca9af263ed70753.avif?t=1761090806\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the visual end, you can control bloom, particles, the motion of the notes, as well as the shape. You can set them to any colour you like as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can even export your polyrhythms to MIDI, allowing them to be used in your DAW of choice.</p>", "short_description": "Build your dreams in this polyrhythm designer. Polyrhythm Lab is all about crafting relaxing or chaotic melodies, which can be played out for hours on end.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/5ea1405ec3c1d9e023764bfec13b3d1193b8cf83/header.jpg?t=1761090806", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/8457523c6d95d03f267a8b64e9643aadf938d4c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761090806", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862580/8457523c6d95d03f267a8b64e9643aadf938d4c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761090806", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-8250U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 90 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i5-8250U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1050</li></ul>"}, "developers": ["Cloud Station"], "publishers": ["Cloud Station"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 499, "final": 499, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$4.99"}, "packages": [1020978], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Polyrhythm Lab", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_t